'''Frostbitten Banks''' is a [[:Category:Difficulty 1|Difficulty 1]] fishing game.

==[[Collections]]==
*Snowhill Pond Fish
*Snowhill Stream Fish
*Extra Large Catch of the Day

==Types of Fish==
*Chilly Grouper - Catchable at level 1
*Winter Piranha - Catchable at level 1
*Frostgill Smelt - Catchable at level 5
*Pacu Pacu - Catchable at level 5
*Blue Thornfin - Catchable at level 10
*Spineless Stickleback - Catchable at level 10
*Goofy Grouper - Catchable at level 14
*Talking Bass - Catchable at level 17
*Ferocious Fangler - Catchable at level 20
*Plattypus - Catchable at level 20
